{"stream": "process", "run_id": "res-0168b546d373", "event": "model_request", "ts": 1787741215.1118913, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "max_tokens": 2000, "search_enabled": true, "search_tool": "web_search_20250305", "search_max_uses": 5, "timeout_s": 90, "prompt_chars": 713, "system_chars": 1496, "endpoint": "anthropic.messages.create", "sent_keys": ["max_tokens", "messages", "model", "system", "tools"], "model_configured": "", "allowed_domains": [], "blocked_domains": [], "system_preview": "# Research prompt — lead_context\n\nYou are the Research Agent for a B2B lead-qualification system. You produce ONE\nshort note that will be stored on a HubSpot contact as `lead_context` and read\nlater by an email agent writing first-touch outreach.\n\n## What you are given\n\n- **The lead**: name, job title, the company they work for, and its industry.\n- **The published post**: a summary of an article our side just published.\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Search the web for what is currently true about **this company** and **this\n   industry**, focused on the themes in the published post.\n2. Write a note that connects the post's themes to that specific company's\n   situation — what they actually do, how the theme lands for them, and the one\n   question a salesperson could open with.\n\n## Rules\n\n- **Ground every claim.** If the search did not support it, do not write it.\n  No invented funding rounds, headcounts, customers, or product names.\n- **Be specific to this company.** A note that would read identically for any\n  company in the industry is a failed note.\n- **Never address the lead directly** and never write email copy. This is\n  context *for* the writer, not the message itself.\n- Target ~160 words, one paragraph, plain prose — no headings, no\n  bullet lists, no markdown.\n- End with one open question a rep could ask, phrased for a first conversation.\n- If the search finds little about the company, say so plainly and stay at the\n  industry level rather than padding with generic claims.\n", "prompt_preview": "Research this lead and write the lead_context note.\n\n## The lead\n- Name: Govardhan Terli\n- Job title: Managing Director\n- Company: Health Catalyst\n- Industry: HEALTHCARE\n- Company website: https://www.healthcatalyst.com\n- About the company: Healthcare data-and-analytics company that unifies data and applies AI-powered insights to drive measurable clinical, financial, and operational improvement for provider organizations.\n\n## The post we published\n- Industry: HEALTHCARE\n- Published: 2030-01-01T00:00:00Z\n- Summary:\nA successful AI pilot in healthcare.\n\n## Your task\nSearch the web for what is true right now about Health Catalyst and the HEALTHCARE industry, focused on the themes above. Then write the note."}
