ht and sustained outcomes for care providers. A strong opening question for the rep: When Health Catalyst's own clients reach the end of a successful AI pilot on Ignite, what does the internal governance and change-management process look like to move that pilot into enterprise-wide adoption?\", 'voice_status': None, 'email_status': None, 'probability': '2', 'last_modified_voice': None, 'last_modified_email': '2026-08-24T13:52:37.327Z', 'company_name': 'Health Catalyst', 'industry_group': 'Healthcare Data & Analytics', 'about_us': 'Healthcare data-and-analytics company that unifies data and applies AI-powered insights to drive measurable clinical, financial, and operational improvement for provider organizations.', 'website_url': 'https://www.healthcatalyst.com'}, 'contact_hs_id': '533990588137', 'company_hs_id': '339297322741', 'company_resolved': True, 'warnings': []}"}
