{"stream": "process", "run_id": "res-0168b546d373", "event": "model_response", "ts": 1787741276.8473861, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "duration_ms": 15943.3, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "input_tokens": 15332, "output_tokens": 529, "web_search_requests": 2, "searches": 2, "sources": 16, "source_urls": ["https://innovaccer.com/news/black-book-recognizes-innovaccer-as-a-2026-leader-in-ai-powered-revenue-cycle-autonomy-and-population-health-data-activation", "https://innovaccer.com/resources/news/ai-trends-in-healthcare-2025-and-beyond", "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260127402414/en/Innovaccer-Unveils-AI-Platforms-as-Healthcare-Leaders-Debate-Economics-Workforce-Constraints-and-Administrative-Burden-at-Xccelerate-2026", "https://innovaccer.com/resources/webinars/ai-trends-in-healthcare-2025-shaping-the-future-of-care-delivery", "https://www.fiercehealthcare.com/ai-and-machine-learning/innovaccer-introduces-ai-agents-providers-automate-scheduling-patient", "https://innovaccer.com/news/ai-trends-in-healthcare-2025-and-beyond", "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20251028190685/en/Innovaccer-Brings-Multimodal-AI-to-the-Frontlines-of-Care-with-NVIDIA", "https://distilinfo.com/2026/03/06/innovaccer-healthcare-ai-himss-2025/", "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260402854770/en", "https://www.apexon.com/blog/2026-and-the-end-of-ai-pilots-scaling-intelligent-systems-in-hcls/", "https://hitconsultant.net/2025/12/16/2026-executive-predictions-why-the-ai-pilot-era-is-officially-over/", "https://premierinc.com/newsroom/blog/the-ai-wild-west-is-over-why-2026-is-the-year-health-systems-must-take-control", "https://blog.shi.com/next-generation-infrastructure/ai/two-billion-hours-short-why-healthcare-cant-afford-another-ai-pilot/", "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12894408/", "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2605.00839", "https://thinking.inc/en/industry-service/ai-in-healthcare/"], "chars": 1552, "text_preview": "Here is the `lead_context` note for Kodanda Naveen at Innovaccer:\n\n---\n\nInnovaccer is not a prospect still evaluating whether AI works in healthcare — it is a vendor positioned at the center of the industry's current challenge: moving customers from isolated pilots to enterprise-wide AI execution. Ranked #1 by Black Book Research in both AI-Powered Revenue Cycle Autonomy and Population Health Data Integration in 2026, Innovaccer's platform has been recognized for real-world execution, operational fit, and measurable impact — precisely the outcomes the post addresses. At its Xccelerate 2026 conference, Innovaccer convened health system and payer executives grappling with rising care demand, constrained workforce supply, tightening margins, and growing administrative complexity. The core question for healthcare technology leaders has shifted from \"How do we try AI?\" to \"How do we run AI as critical infrastructure?\" — a tension that lives inside Innovaccer's own customer base. Research shows 43% of health system executives are piloting or testing agentic AI, while only 3% have agents running in live workflows, meaning Innovaccer's clients face exactly the pilot-to-production gap the post targets. As Managing Director, Naveen likely owns or influences how Innovaccer packages and communicates AI deployment success to prospects and customers. A strong opening question: *When Innovaccer's customers move from a successful pilot to full deployment, what is the single biggest barrier they hit — and how are you helping them get past it?*"}
