{"stream": "process", "run_id": "res-0168b546d373", "event": "mcp_tool_result", "ts": 1787741284.096944, "tool": "get_lead_profile", "attempt": 1, "kind": "object", "keys": ["company_hs_id", "company_resolved", "contact_hs_id", "found", "profile", "warnings"], "result_preview": "{'found': True, 'profile': {'employee_id': 'E00017', 'company_id': 'C0017', 'decision_maker_flag': 'Yes', 'job_title': 'President', 'email': None, 'phone': '+1 (469) 884-7673', 'firstname': 'Mahesh', 'lastname': 'Puliganti', 'industry': 'HEALTHCARE', 'annual_revenue_m': '6.6', 'frequency_of_purchase': 'Occasionally', 'lead_context': \"**lead_context**\\n\\nAxiom is a global alternative legal services provider delivering on-demand legal talent, secondments, and AI-enabled legal services to in-house legal departments. Healthcare is a named vertical for the firm: its healthcare lawyers serve hospitals, health systems, physician practices, pharmaceutical companies, and medical device manufacturers, with deep knowledge in fraud and abuse, Medicare and Medicaid reimbursement, and health information technology. The macro tailwind for Axiom's pitch is strong right now: over 80% of global in-house legal leaders plan to reallocate law firm work to internal teams or ALSPs within two years, driven by rising law firm rates, near-universal AI adoption, and pressure to improve operational efficiency. On the AI-product side, shared client results across healthcare and other sectors show that combining Legora's purpose-built legal AI with Axiom's AI-enabled legal talent is delivering faster turnarounds and significant cost savings for in-house legal teams managing high-volume legal work. A concrete healthcare example: Axiom deployed an AI-enabled senior lawyer who used Legora to process 344 supplier contracts for a Fortune 10 healthcare company, migrating hundreds of agreements ahead of a product launch, saving the client 70% compared to outside counsel costs. Meanwhile, the regulatory environment their healthcare clients face is intensifying: AI-driven tools are proliferating across clinical care and health insurance operations, and absent a comprehensive federal AI statute, healthcare organizations face a patchwork of FDA, CMS, and HHS oversight layered with a growing number of state AI health laws â\\x80\\x94 exactly the kind of complex, multi-jurisdictional compliance work Axiom's on-demand model is built for. A good opening question for a first call with Mahesh Puliganti: **As healthcare clients grapple with an increasingly fragmented AI regulatory landscape across states, how is Axiom currently scaling its legal talent capacity to keep pace with that compliance demand â\\x80\\x94 and where are the biggest gaps?**\", 'voice_status': None, 'email_status': None, 'probability': '2', 'last_modified_voice': None, 'last_modified_email': '2026-08-25T12:28:35.450Z', 'company_name': 'Axiom Law', 'industry_group': 'Alternative Legal Services (ALSP)', 'about_us': 'Global alternative legal services provider delivering on-demand legal talent, secondments, and AI-enabled legal services to in-house legal departments via a network of vetted lawyers.', 'website_url': 'https://www.axiomlaw.com'}, 'contact_hs_id': '533963448020', 'company_hs_id': '339372046062', 'company_resolved': True, 'warnings': []}"}
