{"stream": "process", "run_id": "res-6f2cda551cbf", "event": "mcp_tool_result", "ts": 1787836638.61971, "tool": "get_lead_profile", "attempt": 1, "kind": "object", "keys": ["company_hs_id", "company_resolved", "contact_hs_id", "found", "profile", "warnings"], "result_preview": "{'found': True, 'profile': {'employee_id': 'E00009', 'company_id': 'C0009', 'decision_maker_flag': 'Yes', 'job_title': 'President', 'email': None, 'phone': '+1 (203) 267-9870', 'firstname': 'Harish', 'lastname': 'Bandla', 'industry': 'FINANCIAL_SERVICES', 'annual_revenue_m': '4.7', 'frequency_of_purchase': 'Quarterly', 'lead_context': 'Capital One completed its acquisition of Brex on April 7, 2026 â\\x80\\x94 the same week the OCC and Federal Reserve replaced SR 11-7 with new model-risk guidance. That timing is the story. Brex is now positioned inside Capital One as an AI-native platform that leverages AI agents to help customers automate complex workflows, reduce manual review, and control spend â\\x80\\x94 precisely the agentic AI category that the revised guidance explicitly excludes from its formal scope on the basis that these technologies are \"novel and rapidly evolving.\" The exclusion is not a safe harbor: vendor LLMs and AI agents are evaluated as third-party relationships, with the expectation that the bank â\\x80\\x94 not the vendor â\\x80\\x94 owns the outcome. That puts Capital One\\'s examiners squarely in a position to ask behavioral governance questions about Brex\\'s agentic workflows, and Brex\\'s own product team needs defensible answers about grounding, audit trails, human-in-the-loop review, and permission controls before those examiner conversations happen, because institutions that build defensible governance now will be positioned to deploy AI faster and more safely than peers that treat model risk as a compliance exercise. Opening question for the rep: \"Now that Brex\\'s agentic expense and accounting automation sits inside a federally regulated bank, how is your team thinking about building audit-ready governance into those AI workflows before examiners start asking?\"', 'voice_status': None, 'email_status': 'DELIVERED', 'probability': '2', 'last_modified_voice': None, 'last_modified_email': '2026-08-25T13:22:17.855Z', 'company_name': 'Brex', 'industry_group': 'Corporate Cards & Spend Management', 'about_us': 'Financial services company providing corporate cards, expense management, and integrated finance software to startups, scaled businesses, and ecommerce brands.', 'website_url': 'https://www.brex.com'}, 'contact_hs_id': '533970643697', 'company_hs_id': '339314474711', 'company_resolved': True, 'warnings': []}"}
