{"stream": "process", "run_id": "res-6f2cda551cbf", "event": "mcp_tool_result", "ts": 1787836696.149548, "tool": "get_lead_profile", "attempt": 1, "kind": "object", "keys": ["company_hs_id", "company_resolved", "contact_hs_id", "found", "profile", "warnings"], "result_preview": "{'found': True, 'profile': {'employee_id': 'E00015', 'company_id': 'C0015', 'decision_maker_flag': 'Yes', 'job_title': 'CEO', 'email': None, 'phone': '+1 (469) 312-5418', 'firstname': 'Guna', 'lastname': 'Gangula', 'industry': 'FINANCIAL_SERVICES', 'annual_revenue_m': '4.7', 'frequency_of_purchase': 'Quarterly', 'lead_context': \"MoneyLion, now operating as a unit of Gen Digital following its April 2025 acquisition, has been explicitly built around AI-powered financial wellness, with an AI recommendation system at the core of its consumer marketplace. The company scales AI applications across fraud prevention, budgeting, and personalization, with a centralized approach to experimentation, serving, and governance. That AI-first posture sits squarely in the regulatory gap created by the new model risk framework: the 2026 guidance explicitly excludes generative and agentic AI from its formal scope, describing those systems as novel and rapidly evolving, while a forthcoming RFI on banks' use of AI remains unpublished. SR 26-2 carved agentic AI out of model risk scope â\\x80\\x94 but that didn't make the risk disappear; it moved the governance burden entirely onto the institution. MoneyLion also carries documented regulatory sensitivity: the CFPB reached a $1.75 million settlement with MoneyLion over charges that it overcharged military personnel on loans. With a new AI-powered financial marketplace checkout feature already launched and core systems fully merged with Gen, the pressure to demonstrate AI control to examiners â\\x80\\x94 not just assert it â\\x80\\x94 is immediate and real. A strong opening question: *When MoneyLion's AI recommendation and credit systems come up in an exam or internal audit, what evidence of control does the team currently produce, and how much of that is assembled manually versus built into the system itself?*\", 'voice_status': None, 'email_status': 'FAILED', 'probability': None, 'last_modified_voice': None, 'last_modified_email': '2026-08-26T12:45:14.041Z', 'company_name': 'MoneyLion', 'industry_group': 'Consumer Finance / Personal Finance App', 'about_us': 'Mobile finance app bundling borrowing, saving, investing, and credit-building, including personal loans, cash advances, checking, and credit monitoring.', 'website_url': 'https://www.moneylion.com'}, 'contact_hs_id': '533995992811', 'company_hs_id': '339328872147', 'company_resolved': True, 'warnings': ['contact 533995992811 is associated with 2 companies; returning the first']}"}
